    "content": "We've finished working on CoreFX 1.4 for GTA V Enhanced and now switching to Legacy, full changelog will come after.\n\nHere's a small night time preview of CoreFX 1.4 Path Tracing: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D-4Orwozojk",
